# Trend Analysis Skill
## Purpose
Track failure volume trends over time to assist capacity planning.
## When to Use
Monthly operational review and staffing planning.
## Required Inputs
log_date and unexpected_failure variables.
## Files Used
data/equipment_data.csv, final_report.qmd
## Method
Date formatting (`format()`), aggregation (`aggregate()`), and barplot visualization (`barplot()`).
## Procedure
Run trend code chunk in final_report.qmd.
## Validation
Confirm chronological monthly ordering and valid non-negative counts.
## Output
Monthly aggregated failure count table and barplot visualization.
## Interpretation
Highlights longitudinal patterns in failure events.
## Limitation
Aggregating by month masks daily operational spikes.